<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LEIPZIG, Germany 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000 Leipzig women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix numbers denote seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)  </p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) 6-7</p>
<p>(8-10) 7-6 (7-2) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
